                        "glosses": [
                            "人際關係的"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0d5714f4-46fb-48e2-81ec-acef49701b50",
                                "sense_id": "45a03fb2-71e5-3c09-97e3-2fbd276e1a76",
                                "text": "By slightly modifying Piaget's scheme of the development of the capacity to follow and be aware of rules, I propose to distinguish three stages, or types, of mastery of interpersonal processes: coercion, self-help, and cooperation.",
                                "translation": "通过对皮亚杰关于遵守和理解规则能力发展的方案稍作修改，我提出区分人际交往过程掌握的三个阶段或类型：强制、自助和合作。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e7b3a4b6-64d5-45f7-a8db-874ff8966dba",
                                "sense_id": "45a03fb2-71e5-3c09-97e3-2fbd276e1a76",
                                "text": "The complexity of having so many organisations involved, and the deep integration required, has undoubtedly tested the interpersonal skills of project leaders who have had little face-to-face contact.",
                                "translation": "众多组织参与其中，其复杂性以及所需的深度整合无疑考验了项目领导者的人际交往能力，因为他们很少有机会面对面交流。"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
